# REQUIRES: python-api
# Read-only DLPack views of a simulation on the CPU (D220),
# scenario numpy of Inputs/python_dlpack.py: NumPy's from_dlpack as the
# consumer.
# RUN: %mdir_python %S/Inputs/python_dlpack.py %S/Inputs/dipeptide CPU numpy | FileCheck %s
# CHECK: Double: positions float64, forces float64, the program's buffers, rows of state() at ids, runs blocked by 6 leases and allowed after them
# CHECK: Mixed: positions float64, forces float64, the program's buffers, rows of state() at ids, runs blocked by 6 leases and allowed after them
# CHECK: Mixed, not deterministic: positions float64, forces float32, the program's buffers, rows of state() at ids, runs blocked by 6 leases and allowed after them
# CHECK: capsules released once, taken or not, legacy or versioned; refusals; an array outlives its simulation
# CHECK: a run with a CheckpointReporter refused by run under a lease
# CHECK: a minimization refused under a lease; no view after a failure
# CHECK: no view after a checkpoint or before the first run of a continuation: the cause and a remedy that is accepted; no evaluation by a read
# CHECK: dlpack numpy passed
